| Total cost | ${self.results["rule_based"]["total_cost_aud"]} |
| Average SOC | {self.results["rule_based"]["avg_soc_pct"]}% |

### Learned Scheduler

| Metric | Value |
|--------|-------|
| Self-consumption rate | {self.results["learned"]["self_consumption_rate_pct"]}% |
| Grid import | {self.results["learned"]["grid_import_kwh"]} kWh |
| Total cost | ${self.results["learned"]["total_cost_aud"]} |
